{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"f5514ce8ceed44eefa99f4a8","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61%40oss.qualcomm.com/","channels":["linux-arm-msm"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61%40oss.qualcomm.com/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com"},"subject":"[PATCH v2 0/2] arm64: dts: qcom: ipq5018: Add MDIO pinctrl and enable MDIO/PHY on RDP432-c2","messages":{"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com":{"id":"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","messageId":"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","references":[],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Luo Jie","address":"jie.luo@oss.qualcomm.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Bjorn Andersson","address":"andersson@kernel.org"},{"name":"Konrad Dybcio","address":"konradybcio@kernel.org"},{"name":"Rob Herring","address":"robh@kernel.org"},{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Conor Dooley","address":"conor+dt@kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"devicetree@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"Luo Jie","address":"jie.luo@oss.qualcomm.com"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-14T14:22:24.000Z","iso":"2026-08-14T14:22:24.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"[PATCH v2 0/2] arm64: dts: qcom: ipq5018: Add MDIO pinctrl and enable MDIO/PHY on RDP432-c2","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"This is v2 of the series enabling the two MDIO buses on the IPQ5018\nplatform. v1 (this series' patch 1) added TLMM pinctrl for the\nexternal MDIO bus (mdio1) and is still under review upstream; it is\ncarried into this v2 with a clarified commit message noting that the\nMDIO pin configuration is identical across all IPQ5018 RDP boards."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"v2 adds a second patch that actually makes use of the MDIO buses on\nthe RDP432-c2 board: it enables mdio0, used by the SoC-integrated\nEPHY, and mdio1, used by an external QCA8081 PHY, and describes the\nQCA8081 PHY node on mdio1."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Signed-off-by: Luo Jie <jie.luo@oss.qualcomm.com>"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[]},"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-1-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com":{"id":"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-1-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","messageId":"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-1-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","references":["20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com"],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Luo Jie","address":"jie.luo@oss.qualcomm.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Bjorn Andersson","address":"andersson@kernel.org"},{"name":"Konrad Dybcio","address":"konradybcio@kernel.org"},{"name":"Rob Herring","address":"robh@kernel.org"},{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Conor Dooley","address":"conor+dt@kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"devicetree@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"Luo Jie","address":"jie.luo@oss.qualcomm.com"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-14T14:22:25.000Z","iso":"2026-08-14T14:22:25.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"[PATCH v2 1/2] arm64: dts: qcom: ipq5018: Add pinctrl for MDIO bus","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The external MDIO bus (mdio1) needs its MDC/MDIO lines configured via\nTLMM pinctrl; without this the pins are left in their default state and\nthe bus does not function on boards that enable it."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The MDIO pin configuration is identical across all IPQ5018 RDP boards,\nso add it to the shared SoC dtsi."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Add a mdio_pins pinctrl state for gpio36 (mdc) and gpio37 (mdio) with\n8mA drive strength and pull-up, and reference it from the mdio1 node\nvia pinctrl-0/pinctrl-names."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Signed-off-by: Luo Jie <jie.luo@oss.qualcomm.com>"},{"kind":"patch","patchId":"patch:20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-1-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com:1:0"}],"patchIds":["patch:20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-1-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com:1:0"],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":1,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","parentId":"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com"},"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-2-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com":{"id":"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-2-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","messageId":"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-2-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","references":["20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com"],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Luo Jie","address":"jie.luo@oss.qualcomm.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Bjorn Andersson","address":"andersson@kernel.org"},{"name":"Konrad Dybcio","address":"konradybcio@kernel.org"},{"name":"Rob Herring","address":"robh@kernel.org"},{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Conor Dooley","address":"conor+dt@kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"devicetree@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"Luo Jie","address":"jie.luo@oss.qualcomm.com"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-14T14:22:26.000Z","iso":"2026-08-14T14:22:26.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"[PATCH v2 2/2] arm64: dts: qcom: ipq5018: Enable MDIO buses and add ethernet PHY","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Both the internal (mdio0) and external (mdio1) MDIO buses are present\nin the SoC dtsi but left disabled at the board level, so the board\ncurrently has no way to talk to PHYs on either bus."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The RDP432-c2 board uses the SoC-integrated EPHY on mdio0 and an\nexternal QCA8081 PHY on mdio1 for its Ethernet connections. Enable\nmdio0 and mdio1 with a 6.25MHz MDIO clock, and describe the QCA8081\nPHY at address 0x1c on mdio1."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Signed-off-by: Luo Jie <jie.luo@oss.qualcomm.com>"},{"kind":"patch","patchId":"patch:20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-2-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com:2:0"}],"patchIds":["patch:20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-2-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com:2:0"],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":2,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","parentId":"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com"}},"rootIds":["20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com"],"childrenByParent":{"20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com":["20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-1-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-2-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com"]},"chronologicalIds":["20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-0-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-1-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com","20260814-qcom_ipq5018_mdio_pinctrl-v2-2-ff90d6605d61@oss.qualcomm.com"],"patchSeries":[{"id":"2:arm64: dts: qcom: ipq5018: add mdio pinctrl and enable mdio/phy on rdp432-c2","version":2,"total":2,"subjectStem":"arm64: 